 "name_en": "Continuous Control Monitoring with SAP Process Control (2OH)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Continuous Control Monitoring with SAP Process Control (2OH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, SAP Process Control customers can include <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> processes in continuous control monitoring.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Embedded compliance allows data to be retrieved from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and analyzed in SAP Process Control.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Define data sources and rules</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform query</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get real-time insight into status of internal controls and risks in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and reduced total cost of ownership</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and get visibility of key indicators and metrics by business users</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Deploy and automate routine tasks easily</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get auditability without effort</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 SAP Process Control 的连续控制监控 (2OH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，SAP Process Control 客户可将 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 流程包括在持续控制监控中。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">嵌入式合规性允许从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中检索数据并在 SAP Process Control 中进行分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">定义数据源和规则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行查询</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio842646dfce2e42108f9f2762477b7328__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">实时了解 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的内部控制与风险状态，降低总体拥有成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">按业务用户创建和了解关键指标和指标。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松部署和自动化日常任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">无需投入即可获得可审计性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
